# ── Secrets — NEVER commit ────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
secrets.json
google-services.json

# ── Signing — LOSING THESE IS UNRECOVERABLE ──────────
# The release keystore is the single most valuable file in this project.
# It cannot be regenerated: an APK signed with a different key can never
# update one already installed, so losing it strands every device in the
# field permanently. Back it up offline, in three places, before first use.
# It must never enter git, a chat window, a ticket, or a CI log.
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties
android/keystore.properties
android/keystore/
upload-keystore*
release-keystore*
play-service-account*.json

